                                "sense_id": "5e356545-72b4-39dd-b858-8fed4473b9fa",
                                "text": "And because he was of the same craft, he abode with them, and wrought: for by their occupation they were tentmakers."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "81967e0f-6145-4d1b-8a9c-fef6a47b92b1",
                                "sense_id": "5e356545-72b4-39dd-b858-8fed4473b9fa",
                                "text": "\"Yes, psychic power in its varied manifestations is found in humble quarters, but surely that has been its main characteristic from the beginning - fishermen, carpenters, tent-makers, camel drivers, these were the prophets of old.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a239506a-fdc3-4c6a-9724-a7da3793a962",
                                "sense_id": "5e356545-72b4-39dd-b858-8fed4473b9fa",
                                "text": "His [Paul's] profession as a tentmaker (Acts 18:3) may have been in the family for generations and was fairly lucrative […]"
